{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Imam al-Hujjah (a.t.f.s.)",
  "data": "Recite whenever you are afraid or in difficulty:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ الْحَسَنِ الْحُجَّةَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MUHAMMADABNAL HASANIL HUJJAH\nPeace be upon you, O Muhammad son of Al-Hasan, the proof.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ الْاَمْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAAHIBAL AMR\nPeace be upon you, O leader of the affair.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ التَّدْبِيْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAAHIBAT TADBEER\nPeace be upon you, the director of the affairs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَانَا يَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAWLAANAA YAA SAAHIBAZ ZAMAAN\nPeace be upon you, O master, the leader of the time.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْمُنْتَظَرُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL IMAAMUL MUNTAZAR\nPeace be upon you, O awaited Imam.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْقَاۤئِمُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL QAA'IM\nPeace be upon you, the establisher of Allah's law.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْخَلَفُ الصَّالِحُ لِلْاَئِمَّةِ الْمَعْصُوْمِيْنَ الْمُطَهَّرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL KHALAFUS SAALIHU LIL A'IMMATIL MA'SOOMEENAL MUTAHHAREEN\nPeace be upon you, the good ambassador of the pure and infallible Imams.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اِمَامَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA IMAAMAL MUSLIMEEN\nPeace be upon you, O leader of the Muslims.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah's guide.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَلِيْفَةَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA KHALEEFATA RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nPeace be upon you, the successor of Allah's Messenger, may Allah's blessing be upon him and his holy family.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا فِلْذَةَ كَبِدِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA FILDHATA KABIDI RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nPeace be upon you, O portion of heart of Allah's Messenger, may Allah's blessing be on him and his family.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah's proof on His creations.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَضْعَةَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA BAD'ATA RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nPeace be upon you, O flesh of Allah's Messenger, may Allah's blessing be on him and on his holy family.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا جَادَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA JAADDATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O bounty of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا غَوْثَ الْمُسْتَغِيْثِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA GHAWTHAL MUSTAGHEETHEEN\nPeace be upon you, O helper of the needier.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا غَوْثَ الْمَلْهُوْفِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA GHAWTHAL MALHOOFEEN\nPeace be upon you, O helper of the regretful ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَوْنَ الْمَظْلُوْمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'WNAL MAZLOOMEEN\nPeace be upon you, O helper of the oppressed ones.\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا قُطْبَ الْعَالَمِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA QUTBAL A'ALAM\nPeace be upon you, O pivot of the world.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اِمَامَ الْمَسِيْحِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA IMAAMAL MASEEH\nPeace be upon you, the leader of Jesus Christ.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَدِيْلَ الْخَيْرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'DEELAL KHAYR\nPeace be upon you, O parallel of good.\nاَدْرِكْنِيْ، اَدْرِكْنِيْ، اَدْرِكْنِيْ\nADRIKNEE ADRIKNEE ADRIKNEE\nAccept me, accept me, accept me.\nاَعِنِّي وَلَا تُعِنْ عَلَيَّ، وَانْصُرْنِيْ وَلَا تَنْصُرْ عَلَيَّ، كُنْ مَعِيْ وَلَا تُفَارِقْنِيْ\nA'INNEE WA LAA TU'IN A'LAYYA WANSURNEE WA LAA TANSUR A'LAYYA KUN MA'EE WA LAA TUFAARIQNEE\nAssist me and don't molest me, help me and don't have victory upon me, be with me and don't separate from me.\nتَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى اللّٰهِ شَاكِرًا وَمُصَلِّيًا وَهُوَ حَسْبِيْ وَنِعْمَ الْوَكِيْلُ\nTAWAKKALTU A'LALLAAHI SHAAKIRAN WA MUSALLIYAN WA HUWA HASBEE WA NI'MAL WAKEEL\nI have the trust in Allah by praying and giving thanks to Him, He suffice me, an excellent trustee.\nوَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى سَيِّدِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهٖ\nWA SALLALLAAHU A'LAA SAYYIDINAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nMay Allah's blessing be on our master, Muhammad and his holy family!",
  "merits": "Al-Majmu' al-Ra'iq 1:451."
}
